See also |LED Shields| in Bridle and Zephyr sample:
:zephyr:code-sample:`blinky`.

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/basic/blinky
      :build-dir: mini_usb_rp2040
      :board: mini_usb_rp2040/rp2040
      :shield: "grove_btn_d16_inv grove_led_d17 grove_pwm_led_d17 x_grove_testbed"
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

You should see the following message on the console:

   .. admonition:: Console Output
      :class: note dropdown toggle-shown

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            \*\*\* Booting Zephyr OS build |zephyr_version_em|\ *…*\*\*\*
            LED state: OFF
            LED state: ON
            LED state: OFF
            LED state: ON
            LED … … …
